  "tos_title_1": "1. Acceptance of Terms",
  "tos_content_1": "By using the JointSaathi application, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use the application.",
  "tos_title_2": "2. Medical Disclaimer",
  "tos_content_2": "JointSaathi is an AI-assisted screening tool for osteoarthritis risk assessment. It is not a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always consult with qualified healthcare professionals for medical decisions.",
  "tos_title_3": "3. User Responsibilities",
  "tos_content_3": "Users are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of their account information and for all activities that occur under their account. Users agree to notify us immediately of any unauthorized use of their account.",
  "tos_title_4": "4. Data Collection and Use",
  "tos_content_4": "We collect patient data, screening results, and sensor information to provide AI-powered risk assessments. Your data is processed locally on your device and synchronized when connectivity is available.",
  "tos_title_5": "5. Privacy and Security",
  "tos_content_5": "We implement reasonable security measures to protect your data. However, no method of transmission over the internet is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.",
  "tos_title_6": "6. Intellectual Property",
  "tos_content_6": "All content, features, and functionality of the JointSaathi application are owned by us and are protected by international copyright, trademark, and other intellectual property laws.",
  "tos_title_7": "7. Limitation of Liability",
  "tos_content_7": "In no event shall we be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising out of or related to your use of the application.",
  "tos_title_8": "8. Modifications to Terms",
  "tos_content_8": "We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Your continued use of the application after such modifications constitutes your acceptance of the updated terms.",
  "tos_title_9": "9. Termination",
  "tos_content_9": "We reserve the right to terminate or suspend your access to the application at any time, without prior notice, for any reason, including but not limited to violation of these terms.",
  "tos_title_10": "10. Governing Law",
  "tos_content_10": "These terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India, without regard to its conflict of law provisions.",
  "pp_title_1": "1. Information We Collect",
  "pp_content_1": "We collect personal information including name, contact details, age, gender, and health-related data. We also collect sensor data from wearables, screening results, and usage analytics.",
  "pp_title_2": "2. How We Use Your Information",
  "pp_content_2": "Your information is used to provide AI-powered osteoarthritis risk assessments, improve our services, conduct research, and comply with legal obligations. Medical data is processed with appropriate safeguards.",
  "pp_title_3": "3. Data Storage and Security",
  "pp_content_3": "All data is stored locally on your device using encrypted SQLite databases. When synchronized, data is transmitted using secure HTTPS connections. We implement industry-standard security measures.",
  "pp_title_4": "4. Data Sharing",
  "pp_content_4": "We do not sell your personal information. We may share de-identified data for research purposes with your consent. We may disclose information if required by law or to protect our rights.",
  "pp_title_5": "5. Your Rights",
  "pp_content_5": "You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal data. You can export your data at any time. You may opt out of data collection by discontinuing use of the application.",
  "pp_title_6": "6. Data Retention",
  "pp_content_6": "We retain your data only as long as necessary to provide our services and as required by law. You can request deletion of your data at any time through the app settings.",
  "pp_title_7": "7. Children's Privacy",
  "pp_content_7": "JointSaathi is not intended for use by children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.",
  "pp_title_8": "8. Third-Party Services",
  "pp_content_8": "We may use third-party services for analytics, cloud storage, and AI processing. These services have their own privacy policies and data handling practices.",
  "pp_title_9": "9. Changes to This Policy",
  "pp_content_9": "We may update this privacy policy from time to time. We will notify you of any material changes by posting the new policy on this page.",
  "pp_title_10": "10. Contact Us",
  "pp_content_10": "If you have any questions about this privacy policy, please contact us at support@jointsaathi.com",
